{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:5ede1fb18a211817","name":"Mechanic Droid","source":{"id":"source:reference-5ede1fb18a211817","title":"Mechanic Droid","revision":21068,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:06:17Z","sha256":"96ce0a07030d48d54ea3b65069873cb59df4d0f3fd5f9ee3e4650dd656e341b7","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21068","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Mechanic%20Droid&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-5ede1fb18a211817","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scavenger's Guide to Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["All Mechanic Droids have the following Chassis Traits:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Ability Modifiers:"]}," All Mechanic Droids receive a +2 bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Intelligence"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Intelligence"},", but suffer a -2 penalty to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Charisma"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Charisma"},". Mechanic Droids are technical specialists, adept at repairing machinery, vehicles, and complex devices.\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":["Like other Droids, Mechanic Droids have no ",{"tag":"a","children":["Constitution"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Constitution"}," score."]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Mechanic Droids are typically of Medium size, gaining no bonuses or penalties for their size."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Speed:"]}," Mechanic Droids have a base speed of 6 squares and use ",{"tag":"a","children":["Walking"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Walking","referenceId":"reference:1dabd5131fa6e9e4"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Tracked"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Tracked","referenceId":"reference:c273ea40b157fd8a"},", or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wheeled"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wheeled","referenceId":"reference:cd7bb26315f7b177"}," Locomotion."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Droid Traits:"]}," Mechanic Droids are ",{"tag":"a","children":["2nd-Degree Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/2nd-Degree_Droids","referenceId":"reference:a314fe9a0993afad"}," and have all Droid immunities and typical ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid Traits"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid_Traits"},"."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Bonus Equipment:"]}," Mechanic Droids are constructed with the following ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid Systems"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid_Systems"}," installed in each:\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Walking"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Walking","referenceId":"reference:1dabd5131fa6e9e4"}," Locomotion, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Tracked"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Tracked","referenceId":"reference:c273ea40b157fd8a"}," Locomotion, or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wheeled"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wheeled","referenceId":"reference:cd7bb26315f7b177"}," Locomotion"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Basic Processor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Basic_Processor","referenceId":"reference:14597e432df54ad5"}]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["2 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hand"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hand","referenceId":"reference:fa18c06733fbbf41"}," Appendages and 4 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Tool Mounts"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Tool_Mounts"}]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Diagnostics Package"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Diagnostics_Package","referenceId":"reference:f18faca947488ff4"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Internal Storage"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Internal_Storage"}," (2 kg), and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vocabulator"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vocabulator","referenceId":"reference:a28880d579fbd223"}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Hardwired Design (",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"},"):"]}," All Mechanic Droids are ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," skill. This is a bonus ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained_Skill"},"."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Mechanically Minded:"]}," As Droids experienced in maintenance and repair, Mechanic Droids may choose to reroll any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," check, but the result of the reroll must be accepted even if it is worse."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Automatic Languages:"]}," All Mechanic Droids can speak, read, and write both Basic and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Binary"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Binary","referenceId":"reference:ee1c8277caf5fb9b"},"."]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
